invalid type: string "VWAP Reversion Strategy. Mean-reversion to intraday VWAP when price deviates outside defined bands.. Rule: abs((Close - VWAP) / VWAP) > VWAP_deviation_threshold. Entry: Close < VWAP - VWAP_deviation_threshold * VWAP and (Close - Open) > 0. Exit: Close >= VWAP or time_since_entry > max_bars. Indicators: VWAP, Close, Open, Volume. Market: Gold (XAU/USD). Timeframe: 5m.", expect